# Files that are never deployed to an org
package.xml
**/jsconfig.json
**/.eslintrc.json
**/__tests__/**
**/README.md

# LWC configuration files
**/tsconfig.json
**/*.ts

# Phase 7 UI bundles: deploy only the built app (dist) and its metadata
**/uiBundles/*/node_modules/**
**/uiBundles/*/src/**
**/uiBundles/*/coverage/**
**/uiBundles/*/build/**
**/uiBundles/*/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/uiBundles/*/.*
